# WeChat CDN routing exceptions
# Verified on iPhone 15 Pro with Surge iOS 6.0.1 on 2026-11-23.
# The device's four temporary rules directed these IPs to Direct.
# NOTE: This external RULE-SET has no policy; the profile's RULE-SET line specifies one.
# Narrow /32 addresses are intentional; do not broaden the range without testing.
# If a CDN moves to different IPs, these rules may no longer be sufficient.
IP-CIDR,43.168.80.13/32,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,43.168.80.15/32,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,43.168.80.23/32,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,43.168.80.33/32,no-resolve
